    "Description": "The java-1.8.0-openjdk packages provide the OpenJDK 8 Java Runtime Environment and the OpenJDK 8 Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* JDK: Improve JMX connections (CVE-2026-21925)\n\n* JDK: Improve HttpServer Request handling (CVE-2026-21933)\n\n* JDK: Enhance Certificate Checking (CVE-2026-21945)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
